Masanari Iida wrote:
> 
> Correct spelling "propably" to "probably" and "activ" to "active"
> in sound/usb/usx2y/usbusx2yaudio.c and usx2yhwdeppcm.c
> 
> Signed-off-by: Masanari Iida <standby24x7@gmail.com>

